From b3b287ccf034650001902b47811d861cc797c313 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:14:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(agent):=20pre=5Ffinal=5Fgate=20hook=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20silent=20stop-gate=20hold,=20append,=20stream=20buf?=
 =?UTF-8?q?fer=20[daveey]?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A plugin hook that runs on every text stop and can withhold the answer
without showing or persisting it (unlike pre_verify, whose interim emit
puts the candidate on screen), or append a note. Bounded by
agent.pre_final_gate_max (default 2); hook errors/timeouts deliver
unchanged. needs_buffer=True buffers text deltas for the turn so a held
answer never streams (no surface can retract streamed text);
include_background=True opts into kanban workers, subagents and cron.
---
